@page "/home"
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="home-page">
    <h1>Welcome to our first task</h1>
    <p class="home-description">
        In this task, we created a <strong>Blazor Login Screen</strong> with static user data and OTP functionality.
        Users can log in with their username/email and password. If OTP is enabled for the user, they are prompted
        to enter a predefined static OTP. The application handles active/inactive users and shows proper
        success or error messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Task Summary</h2>
    <ul class="task-summary">
        <li><strong>User Model:</strong> Static user class with Username, Password, Email, IsOtpEnabled, StaticOtp, IsActive.</li>
        <li><strong>Login Component:</strong> Input fields for username/email and password, login button, error display, OTP validation if enabled.</li>
        <li><strong>Business Logic:</strong> Validate credentials, handle OTP if enabled, show appropriate messages.</li>
        <li><strong>Static Users:</strong> Three sample users - one with OTP disabled, one with OTP enabled, one inactive.</li>
        <li><strong>Bonus:</strong> Password hashing, logout feature, responsive and visually appealing UI.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Project Structure</h2>
    <pre class="project-structure">
LoginTask/
├── Models/
│   └── User.cs
├── Services/
│   └── IAuthService.cs
│   └── AuthService.cs
├── Components/
│   └── Login.razor
└── Pages/
    └── Home.razor (protected page)
    </pre>
</div>
